xt upgrade\n\nRT#66040 is not a bug in Parse::nm.\nInstead it is a difference of behavior in perl 5.12 that makes\nLocale::Maketext < 1.16 print warnings. As we are using Test::NoWarnings\nin tests as failure and Locale::Maketext is used indirectly (via perl\nopen '|-' which seems to use IPC::Cmd), we are spammed with CPAN Testers\nreports of users which have an old Locale::Maketext.\nThis patch forces a dependency on a newer Locale::Maketext if it is too\nold.", "created_at": "2011-03-08T11:50:46Z", "repo": "parse-nm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e72941e771b5c853dfd10f23d010be8cead85d07", "message": "Release 0.08.", "created_at": "2010-08-21T02:32:47Z", "repo": "parse-nm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "be34c868bf50ac896d9ea537e33219c8b1d9f015", "message": "Added Test::NoWarnings as a dependency. Specified min perl version.", "created_at": "2010-08-21T02:24:11Z", "repo": "parse-nm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2415e6741dbf7e0a9ea3598d83fce9f1c8f9ae3c", "message": "Using Test::NoWarnings in all tests.", "created_at": "2010-08-21T02:22:11Z", "repo": "parse-nm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "302f2019b980361284a99aa37db9f9a7864adddc", "message": "Print $^O in t/00-load.t", "created_at": "2010-08-21T02:13:47Z", "repo": "parse-nm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cd883fc24dc07a35d469f16c25758a7b76acf4db", "message": "Typo in README.", "created_at": "2010-08-21T02:03:34Z", "repo": "parse-nm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "db6ab52ed6a4574f6e80a02f7a07713ecdef4eb6", "message": "Preparing release 0.07.", "created_at": "2010-08-21T02:00:55Z", "repo": "parse-nm", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8763239835827773523f73f5a7523fd3c2743a37", "mes